        <p>Start with what is on the road. In 2025 the United States had {mil(fleetNow.total)} cars and light trucks. Fewer than 3 in every 100 of them plug in. By 2040, in the federal government’s baseline outlook, almost 4 in 10 will, and the number of plug-in vehicles grows {(fleetEnd.ev / fleetNow.ev).toFixed(0)}-fold.</p>
      </div>

