        <div class="ph__step">
          <span>1 · On the road, 2025</span>
          <strong>{mil(fleetNow.total)}</strong>
          <small>cars and light trucks in use across the US</small>
        </div>
        <div class="ph__step">
          <span>2 · Of those, plug-in, 2025</span>
          <strong>{mil(fleetNow.ev)}</strong>
          <small>{mil(fleetNow.bev)} battery-electric + {mil(fleetNow.phev)} plug-in hybrid · <b>{fleetNow.share.toFixed(1)}%</b> of all vehicles</small>
        </div>
        <div class="ph__step">
          <span>3 · Plug-in, 2040 outlook</span>
          <strong>{mil(fleetEnd.ev)}</strong>
          <small>of {mil(fleetEnd.total)} vehicles · <b>{fleetEnd.share.toFixed(1)}%</b> of all vehicles</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="ph__panels" aria-label="US light-duty vehicles, 2025 to 2040: all vehicles, plug-in vehicles, and plug-in share">
